 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "text": "Some crime scenes' secrets can only be discerned from an angel's-eye view.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Angelic Sleuth",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/12p/angelic-sleuth"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Guilty as charged!\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Damning Verdict",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/15p/damning-verdict"
  },
  {
   "text": "The roar of applause drowned out the melee raging in the lobby.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Grand Crescendo",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/16p/grand-crescendo"
  },
  {
   "text": "Obscura spies rarely stay locked up long enough to make it to trial.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Jailbreak",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/17p/jailbreak"
  },
  {
   "text": "One way or another, everyone gets paid what they're owed.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Smuggler's Share",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/21p/smugglers-share"
  },
  {
   "text": "Few think to look past a familiar face and a friendly smile.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Cephalid Facetaker",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/23p/cephalid-facetaker"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Just one aether tiger? What do I look like, a peasant?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Extravagant Replication",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/25p/extravagant-replication"
  },
  {
   "text": "Beware the fine print.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Storm of Forms",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/32p/storm-of-forms"
  },
  {
   "text": "He's pretty sure he can't get charged with murder if he calls it \"organic demolition.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Bellowing Mauler",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/33p/bellowing-mauler"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Your friends stayed quiet, and look what happened to them. You feeling a little more talkative yet?\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Body Count",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/34p/body-count"
  },
  {
   "text": "As the Adversary's influence grew, the conflicts between families escalated.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Make an Example",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/37p/make-an-example"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Only a fool believes they have nothing left to learn.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Determined Iteration",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/45p/determined-iteration"
  },
  {
   "text": "In New Capenna, it's survival of the richest.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Bribe Taker",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/55p/bribe-taker"
  },
  {
   "text": "The profits from that night barely paid for the damages.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Crash the Party",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/57p/crash-the-party"
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes the trash throws you out.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Grime Gorger",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/72p/grime-gorger"
  },
  {
   "text": "All the money in the world won't buy back a pulse.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Life Insurance",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/74p/life-insurance"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"So many fools think throwing something away is the same as disposing of it.\"",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Oskar, Rubbish Reclaimer",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/77p/oskar-rubbish-reclaimer"
  },
  {
   "text": "Partners in love, partners in life, and partners in crime.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Prosperous Partnership",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/78p/prosperous-partnership"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"That performance was truly the pits.\" —Jetmir",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "False Floor",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/pncc/82p/false-floor"
  }
 ]
}
